{"seq":2,"slug":"memory-layout-control","title":"内存布局精确控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/foundations/memory-layout-control","wordCount":867,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"内存布局精确控制\">内存布局精确控制</h1><p>系统编程要求对数据在内存中的物理排列拥有完全控制——网络协议解析需要字节级对齐、硬件寄存器映射需要零填充保证、FFI 交互需要与 C ABI 兼容的结构体布局。Rust 通过 <code>repr</code> 属性族提供了从编译器默认布局到完全手动控制的全谱系选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Rust 编译器默认对结构体字段进行重排序以最小化填充（padding），这是 Rust repr 与 C repr 的根本区别。系统编程中大多数场景需要显式选择布局策略。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[struct 定义] --&gt; B{repr 属性}&#10;    B --&gt;|默认 Rust| C[字段可重排, 最小化填充]&#10;    B --&gt;|repr C| D[C ABI 兼容, 字段按声明顺序]&#10;    B --&gt;|repr transparent| E[单字段, 与内部类型布局一致]&#10;    B --&gt;|repr packed| F[移除所有填充, 可能未对齐]&#10;    B --&gt;|repr align N| G[强制最小对齐为 N 字节]&#10;    D --&gt; H[FFI / 硬件寄存器映射]&#10;    E --&gt; I[newtype 零成本包装]&#10;    F --&gt; J[网络协议 / 紧凑序列化]&#10;    G --&gt; K[缓存行对齐 / SIMD]\">graph LR\n    A[struct 定义] --&gt; B{repr 属性}\n    B --&gt;|默认 Rust| C[字段可重排, 最小化填充]\n    B --&gt;|repr C| D[C ABI 兼容, 字段按声明顺序]\n    B --&gt;|repr transparent| E[单字段, 与内部类型布局一致]\n    B --&gt;|repr packed| F[移除所有填充, 可能未对齐]\n    B --&gt;|repr align N| G[强制最小对齐为 N 字节]\n    D --&gt; H[FFI / 硬件寄存器映射]\n    E --&gt; I[newtype 零成本包装]\n    F --&gt; J[网络协议 / 紧凑序列化]\n    G --&gt; K[缓存行对齐 / SIMD]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>repr 属性</th>\n<th>字段顺序</th>\n<th>填充策略</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>默认（Rust）</td>\n<td>编译器自由重排</td>\n<td>最小化总大小</td>\n<td>纯 Rust 内部类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>repr(C)</code></td>\n<td>按声明顺序</td>\n<td>按 C ABI 规则填充</td>\n<td>FFI、内存映射 I/O</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>repr(transparent)</code></td>\n<td>单字段</td>\n<td>与内部类型一致</td>\n<td>零成本 newtype</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>repr(packed)</code></td>\n<td>按声明顺序</td>\n<td>零填充</td>\n<td>网络协议、紧凑存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>repr(align(N))</code></td>\n<td>按属性组合决定</td>\n<td>至少 N 字节对齐</td>\n<td>缓存行优化、SIMD</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"repr-c-与-ffi-布局\">repr(C) 与 FFI 布局</h2><p><code>repr(C)</code> 是系统编程中最常用的布局属性。它保证字段按声明顺序排列、对齐规则遵循目标平台的 C ABI，使结构体可以安全地跨越 Rust/C 边界传递。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[repr(C)]&#10;pub struct EthernetHeader {&#10;    pub dst_mac: [u8; 6],&#10;    pub src_mac: [u8; 6],&#10;    pub ether_type: u16,&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[repr(C)]&#10;pub struct IPv4Header {&#10;    pub version_ihl: u8,&#10;    pub dscp_ecn: u8,&#10;    pub total_length: u16,&#10;    pub identification: u16,&#10;    pub flags_fragment: u16,&#10;    pub ttl: u8,&#10;    pub protocol: u8,&#10;    pub checksum: u16,&#10;    pub src_addr: u32,&#10;    pub dst_addr: u32,&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[repr(C)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct EthernetHeader {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub dst_mac: [u8; 6],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub src_mac: [u8; 6],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub ether_type: u16,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[repr(C)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct IPv4Header {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub version_ihl: u8,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub dscp_ecn: u8,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub total_length: u16,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub identification: u16,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub flags_fragment: u16,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub ttl: u8,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub protocol: u8,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub checksum: u16,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub src_addr: u32,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub dst_addr: u32,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>repr(C)</code> 结构体的大小和对齐可以在编译期通过 <code>std::mem::size_of</code> 和 <code>std::mem::align_of</code> 确认。这些值必须与对应的 C 结构体完全一致——不一致意味着跨 FFI 传递时的内存损坏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对齐控制与缓存行优化\">对齐控制与缓存行优化</h2><p>现代 CPU 的 L1 缓存行通常为 64 字节。当多个线程访问同一缓存行中的不同数据时会产生伪共享（false sharing），即使它们在逻辑上毫无关联。<code>repr(align)</code> 可以强制对齐到缓存行边界消除这个问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[repr(align(64))]&#10;pub struct CacheAligned&lt;T&gt; {&#10;    pub value: T,&#10;}&#10;&#10;pub struct PerThreadCounter {&#10;    counters: Vec&lt;CacheAligned&lt;AtomicU64&gt;&gt;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl PerThreadCounter {&#10;    pub fn new(thread_count: usize) -&gt; Self {&#10;        let counters = (0..thread_count)&#10;            .map(|_| CacheAligned { value: AtomicU64::new(0) })&#10;            .collect();&#10;        Self { counters }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    pub fn increment(&amp;self, thread_id: usize) {&#10;        self.counters[thread_id].value.fetch_add(1, Ordering::Relaxed);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    pub fn total(&amp;self) -&gt; u64 {&#10;        self.counters.iter()&#10;            .map(|c| c.value.load(Ordering::Relaxed))&#10;            .sum()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[repr(align(64))]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct CacheAligned&#x3C;T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub value: T,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct PerThreadCounter {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    counters: Vec&#x3C;CacheAligned&#x3C;AtomicU64>>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl PerThreadCounter {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn new(thread_count: usize) -> Self {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let counters = (0..thread_count)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .map(|_| CacheAligned { value: AtomicU64::new(0) })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .collect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Self { counters }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn increment(&#x26;self, thread_id: usize) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.counters[thread_id].value.fetch_add(1, Ordering::Relaxed);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn total(&#x26;self) -> u64 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.counters.iter()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .map(|c| c.value.load(Ordering::Relaxed))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .sum()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 16 核机器上，缓存行对齐的计数器比未对齐版本快 5-8 倍——差距完全来自消除伪共享后的缓存一致性协议开销减少。</p>\n<h2 id=\"packed-布局与网络协议\">packed 布局与网络协议</h2><p><code>repr(packed)</code> 移除所有填充字节，使结构体大小等于所有字段大小之和。这在解析网络协议和二进制文件格式时非常有用，但带来一个重要约束：packed 结构体的字段可能未对齐，对其取引用是未定义行为。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[repr(C, packed)]&#10;pub struct DnsHeader {&#10;    pub id: u16,&#10;    pub flags: u16,&#10;    pub qdcount: u16,&#10;    pub ancount: u16,&#10;    pub nscount: u16,&#10;    pub arcount: u16,&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl DnsHeader {&#10;    /// 从网络字节序的缓冲区安全地读取 DNS 头&#10;    pub fn from_bytes(buf: &amp;[u8; 12]) -&gt; Self {&#10;        // 使用 read_unaligned 避免对未对齐字段取引用&#10;        unsafe {&#10;            std::ptr::read_unaligned(buf.as_ptr() as *const Self)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    pub fn id(&amp;self) -&gt; u16 {&#10;        // 对 packed 字段使用 addr_of! 而非 &amp;self.id&#10;        let ptr = std::ptr::addr_of!(self.id);&#10;        unsafe { ptr.read_unaligned() }.to_be()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[repr(C, packed)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct DnsHeader {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub id: u16,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub flags: u16,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub qdcount: u16,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub ancount: u16,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub nscount: u16,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub arcount: u16,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl DnsHeader {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    /// 从网络字节序的缓冲区安全地读取 DNS 头</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn from_bytes(buf: &#x26;[u8; 12]) -> Self {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 使用 read_unaligned 避免对未对齐字段取引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        unsafe {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            std::ptr::read_unaligned(buf.as_ptr() as *const Self)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn id(&#x26;self) -> u16 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 对 packed 字段使用 addr_of! 而非 &#x26;self.id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let ptr = std::ptr::addr_of!(self.id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        unsafe { ptr.read_unaligned() }.to_be()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Rust 2024 edition 起，编译器会对 packed 结构体字段的引用创建发出硬错误（而非仅警告），这使得上述 <code>addr_of!</code> + <code>read_unaligned</code> 模式成为强制性的写法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"联合体与类型双关\">联合体与类型双关</h2><p><code>union</code> 是系统编程中进行类型双关（type punning）的工具。与 C 不同，Rust 的 union 访问始终是 unsafe 的，因为编译器无法知道哪个字段当前是有效的。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[repr(C)]&#10;pub union IpAddr {&#10;    pub v4: [u8; 4],&#10;    pub v6: [u8; 16],&#10;    pub raw: [u8; 16],&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[repr(C)]&#10;pub struct SocketAddr {&#10;    pub family: u16,&#10;    pub port: u16,&#10;    pub addr: IpAddr,&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[repr(C)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub union IpAddr {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub v4: [u8; 4],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub v6: [u8; 16],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub raw: [u8; 16],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[repr(C)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct SocketAddr {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub family: u16,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub port: u16,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub addr: IpAddr,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>更安全的替代方案是使用 <code>bytemuck</code> 或 <code>zerocopy</code> crate 进行零拷贝转换，它们通过 derive 宏在编译期验证类型安全性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use zerocopy::{FromBytes, IntoBytes, Immutable, KnownLayout};&#10;&#10;#[derive(FromBytes, IntoBytes, Immutable, KnownLayout)]&#10;#[repr(C)]&#10;pub struct UdpHeader {&#10;    pub src_port: [u8; 2],&#10;    pub dst_port: [u8; 2],&#10;    pub length: [u8; 2],&#10;    pub checksum: [u8; 2],&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use zerocopy::{FromBytes, IntoBytes, Immutable, KnownLayout};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(FromBytes, IntoBytes, Immutable, KnownLayout)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[repr(C)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct UdpHeader {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub src_port: [u8; 2],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub dst_port: [u8; 2],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub length: [u8; 2],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub checksum: [u8; 2],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>默认 Rust 布局允许重排，系统编程几乎总需要 <code>repr(C)</code> 或其他显式布局</li>\n<li><code>repr(align(64))</code> 消除伪共享，是多线程性能优化的基础手段</li>\n<li><code>repr(packed)</code> 禁止对字段取引用，必须用 <code>read_unaligned</code> 或 <code>addr_of!</code></li>\n<li>union 访问始终 unsafe，优先使用 zerocopy/bytemuck 做类型安全的零拷贝</li>\n<li>布局属性可组合：<code>repr(C, align(8))</code> 或 <code>repr(C, packed)</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章下一篇 <a href=\"zero-cost-abstractions\">零成本抽象的编译器实现</a> 解析泛型单态化和 trait 对象的内存表示</li>\n<li>跨库参考：<a href=\"../../rust-language/systems-programming/memory-layout\">Rust 语言 - 内存布局</a> 覆盖 Rust 内存模型的基础部分</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"内存布局精确控制","id":"内存布局精确控制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"repr(C) 与 FFI 布局","id":"repr-c-与-ffi-布局"},{"level":2,"text":"对齐控制与缓存行优化","id":"对齐控制与缓存行优化"},{"level":2,"text":"packed 布局与网络协议","id":"packed-布局与网络协议"},{"level":2,"text":"联合体与类型双关","id":"联合体与类型双关"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"所有权边界与 unsafe 系统编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/foundations/ownership-and-unsafe"},"next":{"title":"零成本抽象的编译器实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/foundations/zero-cost-abstractions"}}